      "value": "I found Coherent UI for Unity3D has \"Compensate gamma\" option.\n\nhttps://coherent-labs.com/Documentation/unity/df/d7c/_unity_programmer_a_p_i.html#CoherentUIViewPropertiesDesktop\n\nThis issue might be caused by mismatching this option and expecting color space of VRChat world.",
